WEBVTT

33:03.097 --> 33:07.351
I alone have information that reveals
this weapon's only weakness.

33:07.435 --> 33:09.645
And you, my friend,
are responsible

33:09.729 --> 33:13.106
for delaying my rendezvous
with Star Command!

33:13.191 --> 33:16.693
You... are... a... toy!

33:16.778 --> 33:19.029
You aren't the real
Buzz Lightyear! You're a...

33:19.113 --> 33:23.909
You're an action figure!
You are a child's plaything!

33:24.827 --> 33:28.538
You are a sad, strange little man,
and you have my pity.

33:28.623 --> 33:29.790
Farewell.

33:29.874 --> 33:32.959
Oh, yeah?
Well, good riddance, ya loony!
